{"id":47352,"ord":64,"n_segments":152,"prev":47351,"next":47353,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Guitar technique and later career","title":"Fingering and picking technique","category":"music_technique_style","summary":"He played with first two fingers alternating and the thumb on bass strings, and did glisses with thumb or the whole hand.","period":"1930s","year_from":1930,"year_to":1939,"words":94,"start":[110,6],"end":[111,2],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125#s47352","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[],"story":{"theme":12,"theme_name":"Banjo, guitar and the rhythm section: instruments and players","community":21,"community_name":"Banjo, guitar and the rhythm section's changing role","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":110,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"At that time you were playing mostly with your first two fingers, right? The index finger and your middle finger, right?"},{"p":110,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. And my thumb."},{"p":110,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And your thumb would come in on the bass strings."},{"p":110,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"That's right."},{"p":110,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"But when you take those lines and those little double time figures?"},{"p":110,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":110,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"That was mostly with the two fingers going back and forth."},{"p":110,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. Like this."},{"p":110,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Alternating."},{"p":110,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. And the glisses."},{"p":110,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And then gliss-ing."},{"p":110,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Come down with my thumb."},{"p":110,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Left hand."},{"p":111,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Sometimes with my hand."},{"p":111,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":111,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"You know, the whole hand, come down on the strings."}]}